{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:46 2026-10-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:46 2026-10-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:46 2026-10-11 HKT</p><p>韓國人氣女星全昭彌（Jeon Somi）早前來港出席時裝品牌活動，同場還有陳凱琳、吳家忻、張蔓姿、海兒、江若琳、鄧月平、徐㴓喬、周婷、Taylor R、Sue Chang等。</p><h2>全昭彌被譽為「人間芭比」</h2><img alt=\"全昭彌被譽為「人間芭比」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f58c988b096f36510e8a082fd2f840a1/2026-10/1T4A2944.jpg\"/><img alt=\"全昭彌來港出席時裝品牌活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0f13113b05dd4179a189ac791c18b6e/2026-10/1T4A2963_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"Stacey Bendet（右）與全昭彌合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c084f11f46ee61853a669b2d61e601ec/2026-10/Copy_of_1S6A5189_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"全昭彌、Stacey Bende、Amanda S\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/563a0da96a162013be3b0ca33bbfa523/2026-10/Somi_Stacey_and_AmandaS.jpg\"/><img alt=\"江若琳\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be0f1a40504b1364a598c5908f3ffcc1/2026-10/Elanne_Kong_2.jpg\"/><img alt=\"陳凱琳性感又時尚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0582464752368621a1611e04c1bde6ba/2026-10/Grace_Chan_2.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"徐㴓喬\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0835302104da4281a341f0ca40c4ebc4/2026-10/Asha_Cuthbert_1.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"吳家忻穿上花花V領連身裙和背心亮相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/decb8305bbc87e2b0b885d3d0b3d5c5c/2026-10/Kayan.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林千渟與張蔓姿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e55979f174d94c49c77e615f27158032/2026-10/Lamting_and_Gigi_Cheung.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"鄧月平\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7063ed1e1bdb7bab9821162aee3607c/2026-10/Larine_Tang_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"Taylor R、Sue Chang\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffddebd21e08e2486f58513734108bfb/2026-10/Taylor_R_Sue_Cheng.jpg\"/><img alt=\"周婷是2026年「環球小姐」（Miss Universe）香港區總決賽冠軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6106ef56e90de4a005c1617a685847d/2026-10/Jen_Zhou_3.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"202